teps, functions, and shell blocks to state-machine behavior.\",\n\"Schemas and contracts for requests, markers, manifests, evaluator answers, validation results, and archives.\",\n\"Deterministic validation checks, blocking gates, and continuation conditions.\",\n\"Authoritative definitions of SBE PASS and FAIL and distinction from schema or infrastructure failure.\",\n\"Required handling of malformed inputs, missing files, crypto errors, API errors, git errors, and workflow failures.\",\n\"Permitted retries, attempt limits, repair sequencing, payloads, and termination conditions.\",\n\"Behavior under repetition, resumption, retriggering, and partial completion.\",\n\"Conditions that must remain true throughout SBE execution.\",\n\"Required temporal ordering and prohibited reorderings among SBE stages.\",\n\"Inputs and outputs across agent, workflow, evaluator, Gemini, git/GitHub, archive tools, and storage.\",\n\"Authoritative evidence sources for material SBE state claims.\",\n\"Conditions that must all be verified before SBE may be represented as complete.\",\n\"Deterministic independent verification procedure for final SBE state.\",\n\"Unit, integration, negative, integrity, lifecycle, retry, and end-to-end SBE tests.\",\n\"Representative failures and required resulting states, exit codes, evidence, and allowed next actions.\",\n\"Mapping of requirements and invariants to implementation, checks, artifacts, tests, and evidence.\",\n\"How to initiate, observe, diagnose, recover, and intervene in SBE operations.\",\n\"Rules for safely changing schemas, workflows, scripts, ordering, secrets, transitions, or completion semantics.\",\n\"Documented implementation limitations, unsupported behavior, assumptions, and non-goals.\",\n\"Definitions of SBE-specific terms, states, artifacts, roles, and status vocabulary.\",\n\"Supporting paths, schemas, examples, transition tables, sequence representation, indexes, and validation tables.\",\n\"Verifies the required repository-root relationship among Special Reports, GeminiSupervisor, and GeminiEvaluation.\",\n\"Top-level SBE end-to-end protocol and state machine specification outline.\"\n]\nlens=[len(d) for d in descs]\nmax(lens), descs[lens.index(max(lens))], 169+max(lens), min(lens), 169+min(lens)\n"}
